  "details": "For the past few weeks, Im no longer able to properly join a world my friends are at because the list slowly over the course of a session will group all my friends in a single world in the friends location menu.. which leads me to sometimes joining a lessor populated instance where like in the past, is actually empty. This is also accompanied by seeing peoples in-game status as offline (above their model) when they are right next to me. In order for me to accurately join an instance, is going to the worlds submenu and throw a dart at an instance. \n\nSimilar issues are happening with the friends list so I cant tell when someone is actually online or offline\n\nThis was temporarily fixed by switching from the beta back to normal builds but as stated it was temporary. It only lasted for 1 hour before going back to having the bug \n\nthis isnt tied down to one build number",
